    "good_play": "The Archers are the threat: they shoot Hymnal's Spearman every turn without retaliation, and they are weak in melee (8 strength) and get no terrain defence. Keep Hymnal's Spearman fortified until an Archer stands adjacent in the open, then strike it and step back; never trade blows with a full-health Mongol Spearman outside the walls. Bring Spearman #21 back into Requiem Deep, finish the Archer there (34 Production stored) and walk it to Hymnal to shoot back from inside the city. Switch Hymnal to an Archer too. Walls can't arrive inside 15 turns, so don't detour into Fortification. Offer peace once two Mongol units are down.",
